OL,3,GNEWSAM60 shut after lorry crosses
OL,4,Acentral reservation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the M60 has been closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections after a lorry crossed the
OL,8,Fcentral reservation.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the serious
OL,11,Fcrash happened at junction 15, where
OL,12,Fthe M60 meets the M61 near Swinton in
OL,13,FGreater Manchester.
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police said the
OL,16,Fheavy goods vehicle hit the central
OL,17,Freservation and leaked fuel. A
OL,18,Fspokesperson said nobody was injured in
OL,19,Fthe incident.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
